        en="One needle loom run carries several tapes of different widths, so three sizes at 1,000 pieces each can be scheduled together and MOQ falls to 1,000–2,000 per style. A shuttle loom runs one tape and any change means stopping to re-thread, so MOQ usually starts at 3,000 and unit price runs 1.5–2× higher. Practical advice: face label on the shuttle loom, size tabs and care labels on the needle loom, quoted separately — that moves the number far more than one round of price pressure.",
